[{"answer":"Good Morning. Youth Council. Caroline speaking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hello, I'm interested in standing for election to the Youth Council,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and I was told to give you a call.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I have your name, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's Roger Brown.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm Caroline, the Youth Council administrator.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/8.mp3"},{"answer":"So do you know much about what the Council does, Roger?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I've talked to Stephanie -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I think she's the chair of the Council.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/11.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/12.mp3"},{"answer":"And she told me a lot about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/13.mp3"},{"answer":"How it's a way for young people to discuss local issues, for example,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/14.mp3"},{"answer":"and make suggestions to the town council.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/15.mp3"},{"answer":"That's what made me interested.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine. Well let me take down some of your details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/17.mp3"},{"answer":"First of all, how old are you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/18.mp3"},{"answer":"You know the Council is for young people aged from 13 to 18?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I've just turned 18.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/20.mp3"},{"answer":"And where do you live, Roger?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's a bit complicated.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/22.mp3"},{"answer":"At the moment I'm looking for a flat to rent here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/23.mp3"},{"answer":"so I'm in a hostel from Monday to Friday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I go back to my parents' place at the weekend.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/25.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, so where's the best place to send you some information about the Council?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, to my parent's address, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/27.mp3"},{"answer":"That's 17, Buckleigh Street -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/28.mp3"},{"answer":"B-U-C-K-L-E-I-G-H Street,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Stamford, Lincolnshire,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/30.mp3"},{"answer":"though you don't really need the county.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I know Stamford - it's a lovely town.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/32.mp3"},{"answer":"And what's the postcode?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/33.mp3"},{"answer":"PE9 7QT.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/35.mp3"},{"answer":"So are you working here, or are you a student?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I started studying at the university a couple of weeks ago,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/37.mp3"},{"answer":"and I've got a part-time job for a few hours a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/38.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I've done several different things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I've just finished a short-term contract as a courier,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/41.mp3"},{"answer":"and now I'm working as a waiter in one of the big hotels.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/42.mp3"},{"answer":"That can't leave you much time for studying!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, it's not too bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I manage to fit it all in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/45.mp3"},{"answer":"What are you studying?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/46.mp3"},{"answer":"My ambition is to go into parliament eventually,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/47.mp3"},{"answer":"so my major subject is politics.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/48.mp3"},{"answer":"That's partly why I think the Youth Council is important and want to be a part of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/49.mp3"},{"answer":"And I suppose you're also taking a minor subject, aren't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/50.mp3"},{"answer":"I know a lot of people study economics too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I chose history.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/52.mp3"},{"answer":"To be honest, I'm not finding it as interesting as I expected!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/53.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, so with your studying and your part-time job,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/54.mp3"},{"answer":"do you have time for any other interests or hobbies?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I spend quite a lot of time cycling -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/56.mp3"},{"answer":"both around town to get to university and to work,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/57.mp3"},{"answer":"and also long-distance, from here to London, for instance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/58.mp3"},{"answer":"That's pretty impressive!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/60.mp3"},{"answer":"For relaxation I'm also keen on the cinema -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I used to go at least once a week, but I can't manage to go so often now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you sure you'll have enough time for the Youth Council?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I've worked out that I can afford to reduce my hours at work, and that will make the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/65.mp3"},{"answer":"So is there any particular aspect of the Youth Council's work that appeals to you, Roger?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, my sister is blind,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/67.mp3"},{"answer":"so I'm particularly interested in working with disabled young people,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/68.mp3"},{"answer":"to try and improve the quality of their lives.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/69.mp3"},{"answer":"That's great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the best way to get involved is to be nominated by some people who you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you tell me how to set about organising that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/73.mp3"},{"answer":"You should talk to Jeffrey, our Elections Officer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I can arrange a meeting in the council office with him, if you like.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/76.mp3"},{"answer":"He'll be here next Monday, if that suits you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/77.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the 14th, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/79.mp3"},{"answer":"I can manage late afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you like to suggest a time?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/81.mp3"},{"answer":"He generally leaves around 5.30.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, would 4.30 be OK?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/83.mp3"},{"answer":"My last class finishes at 4, so I'd have plenty of time to get to your office.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, that's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and could I have a phone number we can contact you on?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, my mobile number's 07788136711.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we'll look forward to seeing you next week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Goodbye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/91.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-2-part-1-2023-06-04-16-51-01/92.mp3"}]
